* DLL row-bench testbench, rendered by sim/harness/dllbench.py (placeholders filled).
* Issue #28. DUT: @DUT_NAME@ (@DUT_NOTE@). Simulated, never measured.
*
* Stimulus per spec/target-spec.md "Conventions": ideal input, 50 % duty,
* 100 ps rise/fall at every frequency, 0 jitter; every tap and the lock
* output drive 20 fF to VSS. Start-state sources (swept by sim/harness/
* gridspec.py through corners.supply_v, an `alter`; the deck never changes):
*   vic   control-voltage preset as a fraction of Vdd, released at 100 ps;
*         negative = no preset
*   vton  enable asserted at this time in ns (negative = high from power-up)
*   vtdis enable dropped at this time in ns (>=1e5 = never)
*   vtre  enable re-asserted at this time in ns (>=1e5 = never)
*   vtclk input clock starts at this time in ns (negative = at 0)
* klt sim netlist body: no .lib/.temp/analysis/.end.
Vdd vdd 0 1.2
vic vic 0 -1
vton ton 0 -1
vtdis tdis 0 100000
vtre tre 0 100000
vtclk tclk 0 -1
* input clock: period @PERIOD_NS@ ns, 100 ps edges, thresholds at Vdd/2
Btt tt 0 V = time*1e9-max(v(tclk),0)
Bph ph 0 V = (v(tt)/@PERIOD_NS@-floor(v(tt)/@PERIOD_NS@))*@PERIOD_NS@
Bin in 0 V = v(vdd)*u(v(tt))*(min(1,max(0,v(ph)/0.1))-min(1,max(0,(v(ph)-@HALF_NS@)/0.1)))
* enable
Ben en 0 V = v(vdd)*min(1,max(0,min(1,max(0,(time*1e9-v(ton))/0.05)*(1-min(1,max(0,(time*1e9-v(tdis))/0.05)))+min(1,max(0,(time*1e9-v(tre))/0.05)))))
@DUT_INCLUDE@
Xdut vdd in en tap0 tap1 tap2 tap3 tap4 tap5 tap6 tap7 tap8 lock vc @DUT_SUBCKT@
Cl0 tap0 0 20f
Cl1 tap1 0 20f
Cl2 tap2 0 20f
Cl3 tap3 0 20f
Cl4 tap4 0 20f
Cl5 tap5 0 20f
Cl6 tap6 0 20f
Cl7 tap7 0 20f
Cl8 tap8 0 20f
Cll lock 0 20f
* control-voltage preset: tie vc to vic*Vdd for the first 100 ps, then release
Bicv icv 0 V = max(v(vic),0)*v(vdd)
Bicg icg 0 V = u(v(vic)+0.5)*u(100p-time)
Sic vc icv icg 0 swic
.model swic SW(Vt=0.5 Vh=0.1 Ron=10 Roff=1e12)
* measurement nodes, normalised to the corner's own Vdd (thresholds at 0.5)
Bn_in inn 0 V = v(in)/v(vdd)
Bn_en enn 0 V = v(en)/v(vdd)
Bn_lk lockn 0 V = v(lock)/v(vdd)
Bn_0 tn0 0 V = v(tap0)/v(vdd)
Bn_1 tn1 0 V = v(tap1)/v(vdd)
Bn_2 tn2 0 V = v(tap2)/v(vdd)
Bn_3 tn3 0 V = v(tap3)/v(vdd)
Bn_4 tn4 0 V = v(tap4)/v(vdd)
Bn_5 tn5 0 V = v(tap5)/v(vdd)
Bn_6 tn6 0 V = v(tap6)/v(vdd)
Bn_7 tn7 0 V = v(tap7)/v(vdd)
Bn_8 tn8 0 V = v(tap8)/v(vdd)
Bvrh vrh 0 V = v(vdd)-v(vc)
* start-state evidence: the preset fraction seen at 50 ps (the swept value when
* there is no preset), and the swept sources read back
Bics icseen 0 V = u(v(vic)+0.5)*v(vc)/v(vdd)+(1-u(v(vic)+0.5))*v(vic)
* supply power in mW (zero for a DUT with no supply current, e.g. the stand-in)
Bpw pw 0 V = -i(Vdd)*v(vdd)*1e3
